      ],
      "text": "ANNEX 1. SUMMARY OF SYSTEMATIC REVIEW OF",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 18.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.076904296875,
        56.53472900390625,
        405.3287048339844,
        70.33473205566406
      ],
      "text": "THE EVIDENCE FOR CONTACT INVESTIGATION",
      "font": "TheSans-Plain",
      "size": 13.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.10450744628906,
        73.57325744628906,
        399.2114562988281,
        88.32991027832031
      ],
      "text": "1 IN LOW- AND MIDDLE-INCOME COUNTRIES",
      "font": "TheSans-Plain",
      "size": 13.800000190734863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        103.37181091308594,
        341.96051025390625,
        110.87181091308594
      ],
      "text": "Fox G, Barry S, Britton W, Marks G, University of Sydney, Australia",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        132.10533142089844,
        193.03314208984375,
        141.10533142089844
      ],
      "text": "BACKGROUND",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07211303710938,
        150.27603149414062,
        408.2409973144531,
        159.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigation for early case detection of tuberculosis (TB) is a",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1081085205078,
        162.27304077148438,
        408.222900390625,
        171.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "priority in many low-middle income settings (1). The aim of this review",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.09910583496094,
        174.27005004882812,
        408.18707275390625,
        183.27902221679688
      ],
      "text": "was to synthesize the published evidence on the diagnostic yield of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        186.27304077148438,
        342.48193359375,
        195.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation in low–middle-income settings.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0760955810547,
        216.09934997558594,
        176.20709228515625,
        225.09934997558594
      ],
      "text": "METHODS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0760955810547,
        234.27005004882812,
        408.2005615234375,
        243.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "A search was conducted in PubMed, Web of Science, EMBASE and LILACS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0670928955078,
        246.26705932617188,
        408.3796081542969,
        255.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "with prespeciﬁed search terms, including ‘tuberculosis’, ‘contact’ and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.25608825683594,
        258.1278076171875,
        408.59576416015625,
        267.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "International Journal of Tuberculosis and ‘screening’. Additionally, the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.46310424804688,
        270.12481689453125,
        408.6318359375,
        279.2610778808594
      ],
      "text": "Lung Diseases  and conference abstracts were searched. All titles",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.49908447265625,
        282.2580871582031,
        408.64990234375,
        291.2580871582031
      ],
      "text": "identiﬁed up to 1 June 2011 were reviewed independently by two",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.5260772705078,
        294.2550964355469,
        408.2403564453125,
        303.27593994140625
      ],
      "text": "reviewers. Duplicates were removed, and the abstracts were reviewed",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1164093017578,
        306.27294921875,
        408.13214111328125,
        315.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "by two reviewers. The reviewers obtained the full texts of relevant",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.13441467285156,
        318.26995849609375,
        408.0058898925781,
        327.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "abstracts and extracted data into a Microsoft Access database. The data",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.88241577148438,
        330.2669677734375,
        407.79058837890625,
        339.2669677734375
      ],
      "text": "extracted included the study setting, the numbers of contacts and index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.65740966796875,
        342.26397705078125,
        407.7900390625,
        351.26397705078125
      ],
      "text": "patients screened, the numbers of cases of TB and microbiologically",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.65740966796875,
        354.260986328125,
        408.1864318847656,
        363.27899169921875
      ],
      "text": "proven TB identiﬁed, the numbers of people screened and diagnosed",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05340576171875,
        366.2760009765625,
        408.159423828125,
        375.2760009765625
      ],
      "text": "with latent TB infection (LTBI), information about subgroups of index",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0264129638672,
        378.27301025390625,
        408.1861572265625,
        387.27301025390625
      ],
      "text": "patients (smear-positive, smear-negative, human immunodeﬁciency",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05340576171875,
        390.2667541503906,
        408.1681823730469,
        399.27001953125
      ],
      "text": "virus [HIV]-positive, multi-drug-resistant [MDR]-TB- or extremely drug-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0443115234375,
        402.2637634277344,
        408.1681213378906,
        411.2637634277344
      ],
      "text": "resistant [XDR]-TB-positive) and information about contact subgroups",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.03530883789062,
        412.1414489746094,
        408.54638671875,
        423.2607727050781
      ],
      "text": "< (HIV-positive, children   5 years, household contacts and close contacts).",
      "font": "LucidaGrande",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04428100585938,
        426.2577819824219,
        408.6451721191406,
        435.2757873535156
      ],
      "text": "Data were extracted for incident cases and co-prevalent cases of TB,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0802764892578,
        438.2725524902344,
        408.1859436035156,
        447.2727966308594
      ],
      "text": "deﬁned as cases diagnosed within the ﬁrst 3 months after diagnosis of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06219482421875,
        450.2695617675781,
        408.28466796875,
        459.2695617675781
      ],
      "text": "the index patient or, when this information was not available, at the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.16119384765625,
        462.26654052734375,
        408.3660583496094,
        471.26654052734375
      ],
      "text": "baseline investigation. Only studies conducted in low–middle-income",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2421875,
        474.2635192871094,
        232.0291748046875,
        483.2635192871094
      ],
      "text": "countries were analysed.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.2421875,
        504.0898132324219,
        168.75921630859375,
        513.08984375
      ],
      "text": "RESULTS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.25119018554688,
        522.2605590820312,
        408.3839111328125,
        531.2605590820312
      ],
      "text": "The ﬂowchart of articles extracted is shown in Figure A1. There was",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.25119018554688,
        534.257568359375,
        408.58258056640625,
        543.257568359375
      ],
      "text": "signiﬁcant heterogeneity in the published literature, and the deﬁnitions",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.44918823242188,
        546.2545776367188,
        408.45587158203125,
        555.2725219726562
      ],
      "text": "of cases of TB and the case detection methods used varied considerably.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.95419311523438,
        558.26953125,
        408.104736328125,
        567.26953125
      ],
      "text": "We identiﬁed only one randomized controlled trial of contact inves -",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.98118591308594,
        570.2665405273438,
        408.1498107910156,
        579.2665405273438
      ],
      "text": "tigation (2). The other studies were descriptive, few of which had",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.02618408203125,
        582.2635498046875,
        311.46502685546875,
        591.2664794921875
      ],
      "text": "comparison groups of unaffected individuals.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        622.8968505859375,
        337.31048583984375,
        632.871826171875
      ],
      "text": "available on http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22936710 1",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226.58779907226562,
        651.97265625,
        232.63279724121094,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "51",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
